m\"; described as \"the only true Hurricane Protected Marina Basin in the Bahamas\"; next to Atlantis Marina Village","si":["yacht","sailing"],"commission":"venue","wells":["activities","move","stay"],"draw_rank":36,"tier_absent_reason":"does-not-compete","source":"https://www.atlantisbahamas.com/rooms/atlantis-marina","accessed":"2026-10-02","wells_basis":"full pass 2026-10-05, additive — text"},{"name":"Pompey Museum","blurb":"the former Vendue House, \"Built sometime before 1769, it became a museum in 1992\"","si":["culture","senior"],"commission":"venue","wells":["activities"],"draw_rank":37,"tier_absent_reason":"does-not-compete","source":"https://www.bahamas.com/islands/nassau-paradise-island","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"name":"National Art Gallery of The Bahamas","blurb":"\"your home for Bahamian art\", at West & West Hill Street, Nassau; \"Sundays at NAGB\" are \"Always free for Bahamian residents\"","si":["culture","senior"],"commission":"venue","wells":["activities"],"draw_rank":38,"tier_absent_reason":"does-not-compete","source":"https://nagb.org.bs/","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"name":"The Retreat Garden (Bahamas National Trust)","blurb":"the Ministry''s \"11-acre property...houses one of the largest private collections\"; the Bahamas National Trust lists The Retreat Garden as a national park and reports \"planting six rare palm trees at The Retreat Garden\"","si":["culture","senior","wildlife"],"commission":"venue","wells":["activities"],"draw_rank":39,"tier_absent_reason":"does-not-compete","source":"https://bnt.bs/the-retreat/","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"name":"Potter''s Cay","blurb":"\"locally recommended for those wanting a flavourful taste\" (Ministry of Tourism)","si":["culinary","culture"],"commission":"venue","wells":["eat","shop"],"draw_rank":40,"tier_absent_reason":"does-not-compete","source":"https://www.bahamas.com/islands/nassau-paradise-island","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"name":"Nassau Yacht Haven","blurb":"\"the oldest established marina in the Bahamas\" at 70 East Bay Street, next to the Paradise Island Bridges; vessels \"up to 220 feet\"; Poop Deck Restaurant and The Crew House Bar on site; daily dockage from $4.40 per foot","si":["yacht","sailing"],"commission":"venue","wells":["move","eat"],"draw_rank":41,"tier_absent_reason":"does-not-compete","source":"https://www.nassauyachthaven.com/","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"name":"All Star Aqua Cat","blurb":"\"voted #1 Best Overall Liveaboard in the Caribbean/Atlantic for 5 consecutive years\"; 11 cabins for up to 22 passengers, \"up to 5 dives daily\", daily shore excursions suitable for non-divers, in \"the beautiful Exuma Cays\". CARRIED from the existing dossier (aggressor.com/destination/Bahamas, accessed 2026-07-02): departs Nassau for the Exuma Cays; the Aqua Cat homepage read 2026-10-02 does not name its departure port","si":["liveaboard","diveglobal","ocean"],"commission":"operator","wells":["activities"],"draw_rank":42,"tier_absent_reason":"does-not-compete","source":"https://www.allstarliveaboards.com/","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"name":"Bahamas Ferries","blurb":"\"stress-free passenger travel and seamless freight shipping across eight Bahamian destinations\", with offices in Freeport, Exuma, Harbour Island, Marsh Harbour, Rock Sound, Spanish Wells, Gov''s Harbour and Abaco","si":["ocean","family","group"],"commission":"operator","wells":["activities","move"],"draw_rank":43,"tier_absent_reason":"does-not-compete","source":"https://www.bahamasferries.com/","accessed":"2026-10-02","wells_basis":"full pass 2026-10-05, additive — commission lane ''operator''"}],"faq":[{"q":"What is worth doing in Nassau / Paradise Island?","a":"Stuart Cove''s Extreme Shark Adventure — 40+ Caribbean reef sharks in an amphitheater feed.","source":"https://stuartcove.com/scuba-diving/"},{"q":"Is Paradise Island in Nassau?","a":"Paradise Island is its own island, \"connected to Nassau by bridge\", according to the Bahamas Ministry of Tourism, which presents the two together as Nassau & Paradise Island. Nassau Yacht Haven describes its own location as next to the Paradise Island Bridges.","source":"https://www.bahamas.com/islands/nassau-paradise-island/getting-to-nassau-paradise-island","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"q":"What is the Nassau Paradise Island airport code?","a":"The Ministry of Tourism gives the gateway as \"Lynden Pindling International Airport (NAS / MYNN)\", serving both Nassau and Paradise Island.","source":"https://www.bahamas.com/islands/nassau-paradise-island/getting-to-nassau-paradise-island","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"q":"How long does it take from Nassau airport to Paradise Island?","a":"The Ministry of Tourism says a taxi from the airport to Paradise Island is \"about a 25–30 minute trip\". The page lists no fare.","source":"https://www.bahamas.com/islands/nassau-paradise-island/getting-to-nassau-paradise-island","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"q":"Is there a ferry between Nassau and Paradise Island?","a":"The Ministry of Tourism says there is \"a water taxi, about a 10-minute trip\", as well as the bridge. Nassau Cruise Port describes itself as a hub for \"ferry and tour excursion connections\", including water taxis and ferries to Paradise Island. No schedule or fare was published on either page.","source":"https://www.bahamas.com/islands/nassau-paradise-island/getting-to-nassau-paradise-island","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"q":"How do I get to Paradise Island from the Nassau cruise port?","a":"Nassau Cruise Port, at \"#1 Prince George Wharf\" in downtown Nassau, serves as a hub for \"ferry and tour excursion connections\", including water taxis and ferries to Paradise Island. The port has no on-site parking.","source":"https://www.nassaucruiseport.com/","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"q":"Is Atlantis Paradise Island all inclusive?","a":"Atlantis''s own homepage, read on 2 October 2026, does not describe the resort as all-inclusive; the offer shown was \"complimentary breakfast for two\" on multi-night stays. On Paradise Island, Riu Palace states \"24-hour all-inclusive\" and Warwick calls itself an \"All-Inclusive Resort\".","source":"https://www.atlantisbahamas.com/","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"q":"What are the all-inclusive resorts on Nassau and Paradise Island?","a":"On the pages read: Riu Palace Paradise Island (\"24-hour all-inclusive\", adults-only) and Warwick Paradise Island (\"All-Inclusive Resort is a serene, adults-only escape\"). The Ministry of Tourism also lists Sandals Royal Bahamian, with \"access to a private island, butler service, 11 restaurants\".","source":"https://www.riu.com/en/hotel/bahamas/paradise-island/hotel-riu-palace-paradise-island/","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"q":"Is there a Nassau Paradise Island day pass?","a":"Atlantis says \"An Atlantis Day Pass unlocks a full day of bucket list experiences, no overnight stay required\", and Dolphin Cay says non-hotel guests need day passes, available on a limited basis. Neither page states a price.","source":"https://www.atlantisbahamas.com/things-to-do/aquaventure-water-park","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"q":"When is the Nassau Paradise Island Wine & Food Festival?","a":"The 2026 edition ran \"March 11th – 15th, 2026\" and the 2027 edition is \"April 14–18, 2027\", across Atlantis Paradise Island. Tickets are sold \"Online at NPIWFF.org\" and \"On-site at the NPIWFF Hub in The Royal\".","source":"https://www.atlantisbahamas.com/wine-and-food-festival/faqs","accessed":"2026-10-02"},{"q":"Where can I go scuba diving on Nassau and Paradise Island?","a":"Stuart Cove''s dives walls \"beginning between 40'' and 60'' and dropping 6,000'' into the Tongue of the Ocean\", wrecks including the \"James Bond wreck in 40 feet of water\" and a Cessna from the JAWS filming, and runs a Shark Adventure for certified divers. It books online and on 1-800-879-9832.","source":"https://stuartcove.com/scuba-diving/","accessed":"2026-10-02"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Nassau & Paradise Island: Dive, Resorts & Reef","meta_description":"Dive Nassau''s